@fact isolde.names
# en: She remembers every student's name, and every student's mistakes.
text [00ea88] = 她记得每个学生的名字，也记得每个学生犯过的错。

@fact isolde.portrait
# en: As a student she set the observatory on fire twice. Her portrait from those days is hidden in a forgotten corridor.
text [389493] = 她当学生时，两次把观星台点着了。那时的肖像被藏在一条被遗忘的走廊里。

@fact isolde.chess
# en: She plays tower chess by her window and laughs, short and delighted, when she loses.
text [29f019] = 她在窗边下水晶塔棋，输了的时候会短促而愉快地笑出声。

@fact isolde.thread
# en: She has been following the same thread you have: the seal beneath the lake is weakening.
text [db9906] = 她一直在追查和你同一条线索：湖底的封印正在变弱。

@fact isolde.mercy
# en: She asks students what they think is just, and sometimes she listens.
text [d24034] = 她会问学生，他们认为怎样才算公正——有时，她会听。
